dge%20server%20for%20encrypted%20data%20storage%20and%0Acommunication.%20It%20allows%20users%20to%20communicate%20and%20exchange%20data%20in%20a%20fully%0Aencrypted%20environment%2C%20ensuring%20end-to-end%20encryption%20and%20protecting%20data%0Aprivacy%20at%20every%20step.%20Client%20software%20for%20PrivMX%20Bridge%20is%0A%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.privmx.dev%2Fdocs%2Flatest%2Fstart%2Ffeatures%23privmx-endpoint)%2C%0Awhich%20handles%20the%20encryption.%0A%0A%23%20Introduction%0A%0AUse%20the%20%5BJSON-rpc%20protocol%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jsonrpc.org%2Fspecification)%20to%20call%20API%0Amethods.%0A%0ABelow%20is%20an%20example%20cURL%20command%20for%20querying%20the%20API%20to%20list%20Solutions%3A%0A%0A%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22center-column%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%60%60%60c%0Acurl%20-X%20POST%20-H%20%22Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson%22%20%5C%0A%20-H%20%22Authorization%3A%20one-of-our-authorization-methods%22%20%5C%0A%20--data-binary%20'%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%200%2C%0A%20%22method%22%3A%20%22solution%2FlistSolutions%22%2C%0A%20%22params%22%3A%20%7B%7D%0A%20%7D'%20%5C%0A%20https%3A%2F%2Fmy-privmx-bridge-instance%2Fapi%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%23%20Authorization%0A%0A%23%23%23%20API%20Keys%0A%0AYou%20can%20access%20the%20API%20methods%20using%20API%20Keys.%20These%20keys%20have%20no%20time-to-live%0A(TTL)%20but%20can%20be%20disabled%20or%20deleted.%20Each%20key%20is%20assigned%20a%20specific%0A%5Bscope%5D(%23api-scopes).%20You%20can%20create%20up%20to%2010%20API%20Keys%20by%20calling%20the%20method%0A%5Bmanager%2FcreateApiKey%5D(%23manager-createapikey).%0A%0ANOTICE%3A%20When%20you%20install%20PrivMX%20Bridge%2C%20you%20receive%20your%20first%20API%20Key%20with%20full%0AAPI%20access.%0A%0AAn%20API%20Key%20can%20be%20created%20without%20public%20key%3A%0A%0A%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22center-column%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%60%60%60c%0Acurl%20-X%20POST%20-H%20%22Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson%22%20%5C%0A%20-H%20%22Authorization%3A%20one-of-our-authorization-methods%22%20%5C%0A%20--data-binary%20'%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%200%2C%0A%20%22method%22%3A%20%22manager%2FcreateApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22params%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22name%22%3A%20%22My%20ApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22scope%22%3A%20%5B%22apikey%22%2C%20%22context%22%2C%20%22solution%22%5D%2C%0A%20%7D%0A%20%7D'%20%5C%0A%20https%3A%2F%2Fmy-privmx-bridge-instance%2Fapi%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AOr%20with%20an%20ED25519%20PEM-encoded%20public%20key%3A%0A%0A%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22center-column%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%60%60%60c%0Acurl%20-X%20POST%20-H%20%22Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson%22%20%5C%0A%20-H%20%22Authorization%3A%20one-of-our-authorization-methods%22%20%5C%0A%20--data-binary%20'%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%200%2C%0A%20%22method%22%3A%20%22manager%2FcreateApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22params%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22name%22%3A%20%22My%20ApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22scope%22%3A%20%5B%22apikey%22%2C%20%22context%22%2C%20%22solution%22%5D%2C%0A%20%22publicKey%22%3A%20%22-----BEGIN%20PUBLIC%20KEY-----%5CnMCowBQYDK2VwAyEADsSTjY2wnm1iwWamIWwLTPVhtTIb8TVlI8tts3wkhkQ%3D%5Cn-----END%20PUBLIC%20KEY-----%22%2C%0A%20%7D%0A%20%7D'%20%5C%0A%20https%3A%2F%2Fmy-privmx-bridge-instance%2Fapi%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AYou%20will%20receive%20an%20%60id%60%20and%20%60secret%60%20of%20API%20Key%3A%0A%0A%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22center-column%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%60%60%60c%0A%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A0%2C%0A%20%22result%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22id%22%3A%20%22hysd62jsd7823nasd03%22%2C%0A%20%22secret%22%3A%20%22759a1d8edba555badf1216b0f381b94950141%22%0A%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AYou%20can%20now%20authorize%20requests%20using%20your%20API%20Key%20in%20one%20of%20the%20following%20ways%3A%0A%0A%23%23%23%23%20Signatures%0A%0AYou%20can%20sign%20your%20request%20using%20your%20API%20Key.%0A%0AFirst%2C%20prepare%20the%20data%20to%20be%20signed%3A%0A%0A%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22center-column%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%60%60%60js%0AapiKeyId