r%20Code%20%7C%20Message%20%7C%0A%7C%20----------%20%7C%20--------------------%20%7C%0A%7C%2024855%20%7C%20Store%20does%20not%20exist%20%7C%0A%2C%23%23%20manager%2FcreateApiKey%0A%0AAdds%20new%20ApiKey%20(up%20to%20limit%20of%2010).%20If%20you%20pass%20a%20public%20key%20you%20cannot%20use%0Agenerated%20api%20key%20secret%20to%20authorize%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Parameters%0A%0A%60%60%60javascript%0Aconst%20response%20%3D%20await%20fetch(%22https%3A%2F%2Fmy-privmx-bridge-instance%2Fapi%22%2C%20%7B%0A%20method%3A%20%22POST%22%2C%0A%20body%3A%20JSON.stringify(%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%20128%2C%0A%20%22method%22%3A%20%22manager%2FcreateApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22params%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22name%22%3A%20%22myApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22scope%22%3A%20%5B%0A%20%22apiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22solution%22%2C%0A%20%22context%22%2C%0A%20%5D%2C%0A%20%7D%2C%0A%20%7D)%2C%0A%20headers%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22Content-type%22%3A%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%0A%20%22Authorization%22%3A%20%22Bearer%20TOKEN%22%2C%0A%20%7D%2C%0A%7D)%3B%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%60%60%60shell%0Acurl%20-X%20POST%20%5C%0A%20-H%20%22Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson%22%20-H%20%22Authorization%3A%20Bearer%20TOKEN%22%20%5C%0A%20--data-binary%20'%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%20128%2C%0A%20%22method%22%3A%20%22manager%2FcreateApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22params%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22name%22%3A%20%22myApiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22scope%22%3A%20%5B%0A%20%22apiKey%22%2C%0A%20%22solution%22%2C%0A%20%22context%22%0A%20%5D%0A%20%7D%0A%20%7D'%20%5C%0A%20https%3A%2F%2Fmy-privmx-bridge-instance%2Ftypes%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%3E%20The%20command%20above%20returns%20JSON%20structured%20like%20this%3A%0A%0A%60%60%60json%0A%7B%0A%20%22jsonrpc%22%3A%20%222.0%22%2C%0A%20%22id%22%3A%20128%2C%0A%20%22result%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22id%22%3A%20%22hysd62jsd7823nasd03%22%2C%0A%20%22secret%22%3A%20%22759a1d8edba555badf1216b0f381b94950141%22%0A%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%7C%20Parameter%20%7C%20Type%20%7C%20Enum%20%7C%20Description%20%7C%0A%7C%20---------%20%7C%20---------------%20%7C%20----%20%7C%20-------------------------------------------%20%7C%0A%7C%20name%20%7C%20string%20%7C%20%7C%20New%20api%20key%20name%20(length%20in%20%5B0%2C128%5D)%20%7C%0A%7C%20scope%20%7C%20array%20of%20string%20%7C%20%7C%20New%20api%20key%20scope%20(length%20in%20%5B0%2C128%5D)%20%7C%0A%7C%20publicKey%20%7C%20string%20%7C%20%7C%20_(optional)_%20ED25519%20PEM%20encoded%20public%20key%20%7C%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Response%0A%0A%7C%20Parameter%20%7C%20Type%20%7C%20Enum%20%7C%20Description%20%7C%0A%7C%20-------------------------------%20%7C%20------%20%7C%20----%20%7C%20----------------------%20%7C%0A%7C%20id%20%7C%20number%20%7C%20%7C%20ID%20sent%20in%20the%20request%20%7C%0A%7C%20jsonrpc%20%7C%20string%20%7C%202.0%20%7C%20The%20JSON-RPC%20version%20%7C%0A%7C%20result%20%7C%20object%20%7C%20%7C%20api%20key%20id%20and%20secret%20%7C%0A%7C%20%20%20%E2%80%BA%20%20id%20%7C%20string%20%7C%20%7C%20New%20api%20key%20id%20%7C%0A%7C%20%20%20%E2%80%BA%20%20secret%20%7C%20string%20%7C%20%7C%20New%20api%20key%20secret%20%7C%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Additional%20errors%0A%0A%7C%20Error%20Code%20%7C%20Message%20%7C%0A%7C%20----------%20%7C%20-----------------------%20%7C%0A%7C%2024877%20%7C%20Api%20keys%20limit%20exceeded%20%7C%0A%2C%23%20Policy%0A%0APolicies%20determine%20who%20is%20allowed%20to%20perform%20specific%20actions.%20You%20can%20define%0Ayour%20policy%20on%20three%20levels%3A%20for%20a%20Context%2C%20for%20a%20Container%20(Thread%2C%20Store%2C%0Aetc)%2C%20and%20for%20items%20such%20as%20messages%20or%20files%20(not%20every%20Container%20has%20items%2C%0Ahowever).%20Setting%20a%20policy%20in%20the%20Container%20overwrites%20the%20policy%20from%20the%0AContext.%20The%20property%20of%20the%20policy%20can%20be%20set%20to%20one%20of%20the%20following%20values%3A%0A%0A-%20%22default%22%20-%20takes%20the%20default%20value%2C%20listed%20in%20PrivMX%20Bridge%20API%0A-%20%22inherit%22%20-%20always%20takes%20value%20from%20the%20Context%20(can%20only%20be%20used%20in%20Container%0A%20and%20item%20policies)%0A-%20%22none%22%20-%20no%20one%20can%20perform%20this%20action%0A-%20%22all%22%20-%20all%20Context%20users%20can%20perform%20this%20action%0A-%20%22user%22%20-%20all%20Container%20users%20can%20perform%20this%20action%0A-%20%22manager%22%20-%20all%20Container%20managers%20can%20perform%20this%20action%0A-%20%22owner%22%20-%20only%20Container%20owner%20can%20perform%20this%20action%0A-%20%22itemOwner%22%20-%20only%20item%20owner%20can%20perform%20this%20action%20(can%20only%20be%20used%20in%20the%0A%20item%20policy)%0A%0ALeaving%20an%20empty%20policy%20in%20a%20Container%20or%20item%20policy%20results%20in%20%60inherit%60.%20In%0AContext%20it%20results%20in%20%60default%60.%0A%0AYou%20can%20also%20combine%20the%20values%20listed%20above.%20If%20you%20want%20to%20allow%20item%20updates%0Ato%20be%20executed%20only%20by%20the%20item%20owner%2C%20with%20the%20additional%20assumption%20that%20they%0Amust%20be%20an%20active%20user%20of%20the%20Container%2C%20you%20can%20write%20%60itemOwner%26user%60.%20But%20if%0Ayou%20want%20to%20allow%20the%20Container%20managers%20to%20also%20update%20the%20item%2C%20you%20can%20write%0A%60itemOwner%26user%2Cmanager%60.%20In%20the%20policy%20entry%2C%20the%20%60%26%60%20character%20means%20'and'%2C%0Aand%20the%20coma%20%60%2C%60%20means%20%60or%60.%20Operations%20with%20%60%26%60%20are%20always%20performed%20first.%0A%0A%3E%20Default%20policy%3A%0A%0A%60%60%60%0A%7B%0A%20%22context%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22listUsers%22%3A%20%22all%22%2C%0A%20%22sendCustomNotification%22%3A%20%22all%22%0A%20%7D%2C%0A%20%22thread%22%3A%20%7B%0A%20%22get%22%3A%20%22user%22%2C%0A%20%22listMy%22%3A%20%22all%22%2C%0A%20%22listAll%22%3A%20%22none%22%2C%0A%20%22create%22%3A%20%22all%22%2C%0A%20%22update%22%3A%20%22manager%22%2C%0A%20%22delete%22%3A%20%22manager%22%2C%0A%20%22updatePolicy%22%3A%20%22manager%22%2C%0A%20%22creatorHasToBeManager%22%3A%20%22yes%22%2C%0A%20%22updaterCanBeRemovedFromManagers%2