E%0A%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%0A%2C%7B%0A%20%22title%22%3A%20%22PrivMX%20Endpoint%20Web%22%0A%7D%2C---%0Atitle%3A%20API%20Reference%0A---%0A%0A%23%23%20C%2B%2B%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Core%5D(.%2Fendpoint%2Fcore%2Fconnection)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20is%20a%20modular%2C%20low-level%20library%20written%20in%20C%2B%2B%2C%20ready%20to%20be%20configured%20and%20used%20on%20any%20device%20(including%20IoT%2C%20VR%20%2B%20more)%20and%20any%20operating%20system.%0A%0A%23%23%20JavaScript%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Web%5D(.%2Fwebendpoint%2Fcore%2Fconnection)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Web%20is%20a%20JavaScript%20library%20designed%20to%20work%20in%20browser%20environment.%0AIt%20provides%20a%20functional%20API%20on%20the%20top%20of%20the%20WebAssembly%20build%20made%20of%20the%20native%20PrivMX%20Endpoint%20library%20written%20in%20C%2B%2B.%0A%0A%23%23%20Java%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20Extra%5D(.%2Fprivmx-endpoint-java-extra%2Fcore%2Fbasic-privmx-endpoint)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20Extra%20is%20the%20recommended%20library%20for%20utilizing%20the%20platform%20in%20the%20majority%20of%20cases.%0AIt%20encompasses%20all%20the%20essential%20logic%20that%20simplifies%20and%20secures%20the%20usage%20of%20our%20libraries.%20It%20can%20be%20utilized%20on%20Java%20Virtual%20Machines%20(JVM).%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20Android%5D(.%2Fprivmx-endpoint-java-android%2Fcore%2Fprivmx-endpoint-base-activity)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20Android%20is%20an%20extension%20of%20PrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20Extra%20with%20logic%20specifically%20for%20Android.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%5D(.%2Fprivmx-endpoint-java%2Fcore%2Fbackend-requester)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Java%20is%20the%20fundamental%20wrapper%20library%2C%20essential%20for%20the%20platform%E2%80%99s%20operational%20functionality.%0AIt%20utilizes%20JNI%20to%20declare%20native%20functions%20in%20Java.%0AAs%20the%20most%20minimalist%20library%20available%2C%20it%20provides%20the%20highest%20degree%20of%20flexibility%20in%20customizing%20the%20Platform%20to%20meet%20your%20specific%20requirements.%0ACompatible%20with%20JVM.%0A%0A%23%23%20Kotlin%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Kotlin%20Extra%5D(%2Freference%2Fkotlin%2Fprivmx-endpoint-extra%2Findex.html)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Kotlin%20Extra%20is%20the%20fundamental%20**recommended%20library**%20for%20using%20the%20platform%0Ain%20the%20majority%20of%20cases.%20It%20encompasses%20all%20the%20essential%20logic%20that%20simplifies%20and%20secures%20the%0Ausage%20of%20our%20libraries.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Kotlin%5D(%2Freference%2Fkotlin%2Fprivmx-endpoint%2Findex.html)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Kotlin%20is%20the%20minimal%20wrapper%20library%2C%20essential%20for%20the%20platform%E2%80%99s%20operational%0Afunctionality.%20It%20declares%20native%20functions%20in%20Kotlin%20using%20JNI.%20As%20the%20most%20minimalist%20library%0Aavailable%2C%20it%20provides%20the%20highest%20degree%20of%20flexibility%20in%20customizing%20the%20platform%20to%20meet%20your%0Aspecific%20requirements.%0A%0A%23%23%20Swift%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Swift%20Extra%5D(.%2Fprivmx-endpoint-swift-extra%2Fcore%2Fbackend-requester)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Swift%20Extra%20is%20the%20recommended%20library%20for%20using%20PrivMX%20in%20Swift.%20It%20contains%20all%20the%20features%20that%20make%20using%20our%20libraries%20simple%20and%20less%20error-prone.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%20Swift%5D(.%2Fprivmx-endpoint-swift%2Fcore%2Fbackend-requester)%0A%0APrivMX%20Endpoint%20Swift%20is%20the%20fundamental%20wrapper%20library%2C%20essential%20for%20the%20platform%E2%80%99s%20operational%20functionality.%0AAs%20the%20most%20minimalist%20library%20available%2C%20it%20provides%20the%20highest%20degree%20of%20flexibility%20in%20customizing%20PrivMX%20to%20meet%20your%20specific%20requirements.%0A%0A%23%23%20C%23%0A%0A%23%23%23%20%5BPrivMX%20Endpoint%2